{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And he saw Amalek.</b> In the spirit of prophecy. And he opened first with Amalek, for he is of the seed of Esau, and from his seed came the war against him both at the beginning and at the end — today it is the kingdom of Rome. And therefore he concluded his prophecy with the destruction of Kittim, which is the kingdom of Rome, from the seed of Esau, of whom it is said, ״ואחריתו עדי אובד״ — until there comes he who is destined to remove him from the world, as it is said, ״מחה אמחה״."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:35:47.686586425Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}